# System Architecture

## High-Level Flow

1. User submits query
2. API server authenticates request
3. Query orchestrator plans execution
4. Retrieval service fetches context
5. LLM service generates response
6. Streaming layer returns tokens
7. Analytics captures metrics

## Core Components

- API Gateway
- Query Orchestrator
- Retrieval Layer
- Embedding Engine
- Vector Storage
- Memory Layer
- Observability Stack